Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 02:48:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat: channel-aware tool filtering + terminal code blocks
 + username fix

- gateway/channel_tool_filter.py: new module for per-channel tool restriction
  - owner DM = full access, other DM = restricted, guild = none
  - config-driven via discord.tool_permissions in config.yaml
- gateway/run.py: integrate tool filter at _run_agent and _run_background_task
- gateway/run.py: wrap terminal/execute_code previews in code blocks for Discord
- plugins/platforms/discord/adapter.py: use .name instead of .display_name
  for stable username identification in logs
